# Line endings.
#
# Normalise to LF inside the repository and check every text file out with LF on
# every platform.  This tree mixes the two flavours - part of it was authored on
# Windows - so without an explicit policy a file reports as fully rewritten
# (every line "changed") the moment the working copy is touched and core.autocrlf
# differs from the machine that committed it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images are binary: never normalise them, and keep them out of diffs.
*.png binary

# *.stl is deliberately not listed above.  text=auto already recognises the
# binary meshes by their NUL bytes, and samples/sim env/meshes/03_cogwheel.stl is
# an ASCII STL that belongs under the eol policy like any other text file.